Node ID=01 Conversation Start Male, Not Inquisitor
Text=It is you, the Scion of Lionheart! My Lord, it is an honor to meet you. I am Sir Roger Templeton of the Knights Templar. My sword is yours against these heathens that sully the name of fair England.
