Node ID=20 not english
Text=I beg you to reconsider. Not all of England stands against you. The druids orchestrated the attacks against you as a ruse to steal the True Cross. Despite England's conflict with the Inquisition, there are many English loyal to Richard the Lionheart's beliefs.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=Templar IS
Reply Text=Then your aid is welcome, brother knight. Come - let the Knights Templar deal with these druids.
Go to node ID=10 accept
