Node ID=50 ley lines
Text=Ley lines are unseen mystical conduits running across the land. Some say they encircle the world, remnants of a time when the Earth bathed in magic. Since the Disjunction, the ley lines of Europe have been dormant, but these druids intend to awaken their power. So, shall we fight together?
Should Have Voiceover=1

